Speed 50 feet, burrow Speed 30 feet, immune to [[Immobilized]]; shield (15 Hardness, can't be damaged);

- **Melee** ◆ warhammer (reach 15 feet, shove), **Damage** 6d8+6 bludgeoning.

- **Urgathoa**

Speed 70 feet, fly;

